{
  "name": "Send WhatsApp messages from new Google Sheets rows with Cosend",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send WhatsApp messages from new Google Sheets rows with Cosend\n\n### How it works\nEach new row on your Google Sheet becomes a WhatsApp message from the business number you already use on your phone. Every 5 minutes the workflow takes up to 50 rows with a phone and no status, and the Cosend node's Message › Send delivers your approved template with the row's name. It then marks each row sent, or failed with the reason, so each row is sent once. Replies land in the Cosend inbox and in the WhatsApp Business app on the phone.\n\n### Setup\nSelf-hosted n8n with the n8n-nodes-cosend community node (version tested 2026.11.1; install guide at cosend.app/docs/n8n). A Cosend account on any plan, including Free, with a connection API key in the Cosend API credential. A Google Sheets credential and a sheet with phone and name columns. Pick your sheet in Read the sheet and your template in Send WhatsApp template. Meta bills your WhatsApp messages directly.\n\n### Customization\nChange the columns, send only rows marked ready, or swap Google Sheets for Airtable.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "3f1c2b7a-5d1e-4c2a-9a51-0b7e3c1d2a01",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read the rows to send\nWrite each number with its country code, for example **+44 7700 900123**; spaces and dashes are fine. A row with any status is skipped, and each run takes at most 50 rows.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3f1c2b7a-5d1e-4c2a-9a51-0b7e3c1d2a02",
      "name": "Read the rows to send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send the template\nCreate a template with one variable for the first name in the Cosend dashboard under **Templates**, for example *Hi {{1}}, thanks for signing up.* **Components** fills it from **name**. A template with no variables takes **[]**.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3f1c2b7a-5d1e-4c2a-9a51-0b7e3c1d2a03",
      "name": "Send the template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Write the result\n**sent** means the message went out at the time in **sent_at**. **failed** puts Cosend's reason in **error**: fix the row, clear its status, and the next run sends it.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3f1c2b7a-5d1e-4c2a-9a51-0b7e3c1d2a06",
      "name": "Write the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
